* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode R
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 10
* <Natural Source Header
* COPYCODE TO INIT COLORS VIDEO ATTRIBUTES ETC...
DECIDE ON FIRST VALUE OF *DEVICE
  VALUE 'COLOR'
    CV-SELECTION(*) := G-SEL-CD
    CV-LINES := G-LIST-CD
  NONE /*VALUE 'VIDEO'
    CV-SELECTION(*) := (AD=I)
    CV-LINES := (AD=D)
END-DECIDE
